    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "1 · Two-pass parity note",
      "pos": [
        0,
        -420
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        260
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 21,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 1 · Correct parity schedule / 正确原版计划\nPass 1 uses Comfy `simple` 8-step sigmas split after four calls. Pass 2 uses the published LBH 3-step refine sequence. The older linear base-q 4+4 plan is denied because it kept too much noise late in pass 2 and could destroy structure."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "2 · Two-pass parity note",
      "pos": [
        440,
        -420
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        260
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 22,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 2 · Required pass handoff / 二采接线\nConnect **SamplerCustomAdvanced pass-1 `denoised_output`** to Learned Latent Upscale. Rebuild high-resolution Conditioning, then Reconcile. Pass 2 uses fresh RandomNoise and the final video must decode **SamplerCustomAdvanced `output`**, not its `denoised_output`."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "3 · Two-pass parity note",
      "pos": [
        880,
        -420
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        260
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 23,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 3 · Detail mechanisms belong only to HIGH refine / 细节节点位置\nUse `Two-Pass Detail Mixer` after Reconcile. It preserves refine sigmas. Tail/Bias/STG/Restart default OFF for parity. Tail +3 is the lowest-risk optional start; Bias/STG/Restart change the shared AV Transformer and need separate listening. The old complete-trajectory Detail Mixer must not replace partial pass-2 sigmas."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "4 · Two-pass parity note",
      "pos": [
        1320,
        -420
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        260
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 24,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 4 · Temporal Detail and memory / 解码后与显存\nTemporal Detail Enhance is an IMAGE post-process: place it **after AV Decode** and route decoded audio around it. Learned latent upscale saves first-pass compute, not high-resolution peak VRAM. Default offload_after releases only the learned resizer, not H3/CLIP/VAE."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "5 · Two-pass parity note",
      "pos": [
        1760,
        -420
      ],
      "size": [
        520,
        260
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 25,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## 5 · Known-good starting values / 建议参数\nParity baseline: shift video/audio `6/3`, base steps `8`, coarse `4`, refine `3`, all detail toggles OFF. Optional Tail test: enable_tail=true, extra_tail_steps=3, video_sigma_linear. Compare before enabling Bias/STG/Restart together."
      ]
    }
